  "sequences": [
    {
      "id": "demo-run",
      "split": "rehearsal",
      "description": "PRD §3.3 live example: problem, pipeline reveals, comparison, offline question, return to the problem.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "Let me start with what's wrong with slides today.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "problem"
          },
          "settling": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "You're locked into an order you chose weeks ago.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "problem"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "So how does this actually work? There are four stages.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "pipeline"
          },
          "settling": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "It starts by listening through the laptop's microphone.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "REVEAL",
            "conceptId": "pipeline",
            "detailId": "capture"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "Then my speech is transcribed locally into text.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "REVEAL",
            "conceptId": "pipeline",
            "detailId": "understand"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "Then it finds the prepared concept closest in meaning.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "REVEAL",
            "conceptId": "pipeline",
            "detailId": "match"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "And finally it composes that onto the canvas.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "REVEAL",
            "conceptId": "pipeline",
            "detailId": "compose"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "silence",
          "durationMs": 4000,
          "expect": {
            "action": "HOLD"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "Now compare that with a normal slide deck, where everything's decided in advance.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "COMPARE",
            "leftId": "problem",
            "rightId": "reversal",
            "relationshipId": "slides-vs-follow"
          },
          "settling": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "Slides give you separate pages and a clicker, whereas here it's one canvas and your voice.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "COMPARE",
            "leftId": "problem",
            "rightId": "reversal",
            "relationshipId": "slides-vs-follow"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "Someone asked whether this needs an internet connection during the talk.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "architecture"
          },
          "settling": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "No, the speech and the matching both run right here on the laptop.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "REVEAL",
            "conceptId": "architecture",
            "detailId": "local"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "silence",
          "durationMs": 3000,
          "expect": {
            "action": "HOLD"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "So, coming back to where we started: the fixed order of slides.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "problem"
          },
          "settling": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "That rigid running order is exactly what we're getting rid of.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "problem"
          }
        }
      ],
      "topicReturns": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-override",
      "split": "rehearsal",
      "description": "Manual focus interrupts automatic follow; speech must not undo it until follow resumes; then a topic return.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "It's matching on meaning rather than on exact words.",
          "expect": {
            "action": "FOCUS",
            "conceptId": "matching"
          },
          "settling": true
        },
